msgid "You can then build the libc using:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../full_cross_build.md:220
msgid ""
"To run the tests for the cross-compiled libc, you must use the hermetic test "
"suite, which is entirely self-hosted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../full_cross_build.md:228
msgid ""
"The standard `check-libc` target relies on the target's system C++ and C "
"library headers. Because these tests aren't hermetic, they are not expected "
"to work for a standalone cross-compilation build."
msgstr ""
